{"type":"tool-result","toolCallId":"call_bcb51b847b694e7caae73f09","toolName":"renderRootCauseAnalysis","args":{"severity":"P1","title":"payment-gateway 容器内存触及 cgroup memory.max，被内核 OOM Killer 反复击杀（Exit Code 137）","confidence":0.92,"rootCauseSummary":"payment-gateway-7f8b9-x2k 的内存使用率在 6 个观测周期内由 61% 单调爬升至 97%，呈现典型的内存泄漏/大对象未释放曲线，而非突发流量毛刺。容器工作集顶到 resources.limits.memory 映射的 cgroup v2 memory.max 后，内核 page cache 回收不足以满足分配需求，OOM Killer 遍历该 cgroup 内进程计算 oom_score（RSS + swap 主导），选中最高分进程发送不可捕获的 SIGKILL，容器退出码固定为 137（128+9）。因 SIGKILL 无优雅退出路径，进程无法 flush 或释放资源，重启后堆内存从基线重新累积，形成 9 次重启的准 CrashLoopBackOff。关键排除项：CPU 仅 66%（非算力瓶颈）；所在节点 worker-beta 内存水位仅 51%（非节点级资源耗尽或 Eviction，故节点驱逐/迁移无收益）。依据 RUNBOOK-K8S-042 判据，limit 若远高于真实需求仍 OOM 通常指向真实泄漏，需 heap profile 定性。","evidenceChain":["T0 内存使用率由基线 61% 开始持续单调上升 → 68% → 74% → 83% → 91% → 97%，无回落平台期，符合堆内存泄漏特征","T1 内存触及容器 cgroup memory.max（由 resources.limits.memory 映射），page cache 回收失效","T2 内核 OOM Killer 计算 oom_score（主要依据 RSS + swap，受 oom_score_adj 偏移）并选中主进程发送 SIGKILL","T3 容器 Last State: Terminated, Reason=OOMKilled, Exit Code=137（128 + 9），SIGKILL 不可捕获故无优雅退出","T4 kubelet 按指数退避重启（10s 起，上限 5 分钟），累计 restarts=9，Pod 呈现 OOMKilled 循环","T5 旁证排除：CPU=66.0% 未饱和；节点 worker-beta mem=51% / cpu=42%，节点侧资源充裕，非节点驱逐场景"],"impactScope":"命名空间 kv-prod 的支付入口服务 payment-gateway 当前仅观测到 1 个异常副本（node-worker-beta），但集群入口 QPS 2400 且集群健康分已降至 58/100。SIGKILL 为硬终止，重启窗口内的在途请求会被直接断连，可能产生支付订单状态不一致与 5xx 抖动；若该 Deployment 副本数较少，OOM 循环将进一步打穿支付链路，属 P1 级需当日闭环故障。","ragReferences":[{"id":"RUNBOOK-K8S-042","title":"Pod OOMKilled 应急处置手册（Cgroup 内存超限）","category":"memory","tags":["oom","oomkilled","memory","cgroup","restart","crashloop"],"symptom":"Pod 频繁重启，kubectl describe pod 显示 Last State: Terminated, Reason: OOMKilled, Exit Code: 137；容器内存使用触及 limit 上限。","remediationSteps":["kubectl describe pod <pod> -n <ns> 确认 OOMKilled 与 Exit Code 137","kubectl top pod <pod> --containers 观察实际内存峰值","比对 resources.limits.memory 与容器真实峰值，判断是 limit 过低还是内存泄漏","若为泄漏：抓取 heap profile（/debug/pprof/heap 或 jmap）定位增长对象","临时缓解：提升 limit 至峰值的 1.3 倍并重启；根因修复后回落","配置 HPA 基于 memory 指标或接入 VPA 自动调优"],"featureVocabulary":["oom","oomkilled","exit code 137","cgroup","memory limit","out of memory","memory leak","rss","rlimit","crashloopbackoff","restart"],"rootCauseMechanism":"Linux 内核 OOM Killer 在 cgroup v2 的 memory.max 被触及时介入：内核遍历该 cgroup 内的进程计算 oom_score（主要由 rss + swap 用量决定，可由 oom_score_adj 偏移），选中最高分进程发送 SIGKILL。因 SIGKILL 不可捕获，进程无机会优雅退出，故容器退出码固定为 137（128 + 9）。在 cgroup v1 下对应 memory.limit_in_bytes 与 memory.oom_control。Kubernetes 将 Pod 的 resources.limits.memory 映射为容器 cgroup 的 memory.max；当容器工作集超过该值且回收（page cache 回收）仍不足以满足需求时必然触发 OOM。若 limit 远高于实际需求而仍 OOM，通常说明存在真实的堆内存泄漏或大对象未释放。","relatedChaos":["POD_OOM_SWARM"],"similarityScore":0.9094,"matchedTerms":["oom","pod"],"scoreBreakdown":{"vectorScore":0.3344,"bm25Score":0.6331,"contextBoost":0.75,"rrfScore":1},"isCustom":false},{"id":"RUNBOOK-K8S-043","title":"CrashLoopBackOff 崩溃循环排障手册","category":"runtime","tags":["crashloop","crashloopbackoff","restart","backoff","probe"],"symptom":"Pod 状态在 Running 与 CrashLoopBackOff 之间反复切换，restarts 计数持续增长，kubelet 按指数退避策略拉长重启间隔。","remediationSteps":["kubectl logs <pod> --previous 查看上一次崩溃前的最后输出","kubectl describe pod <pod> 检查 Events 中的 Back-off restarting failed container","确认启动命令与探针配置：livenessProbe 的 initialDelaySeconds 是否过短","检查 ConfigMap/Secret 挂载与依赖服务可达性","如为探针误杀：放宽 failureThreshold 或调整 timeoutSeconds"],"featureVocabulary":["crashloopbackoff","back-off","restarting failed container","liveness probe","readiness probe","restart","exit code","still running"],"rootCauseMechanism":"kubelet 对反复失败的容器实施指数退避重启（10s 起，上限 5 分钟），退避期间 Pod phase 为 Running 但容器未运行，状态显示为 CrashLoopBackOff。常见触发源：应用启动即崩溃、依赖不可达导致启动超时、livenessProbe 配置过激（initialDelaySeconds 小于真实启动耗时）导致容器被主动杀死。探针失败由 kubelet 发送 SIGTERM 后等待 terminationGracePeriodSeconds，超时再 SIGKILL。","relatedChaos":["POD_OOM_SWARM"],"similarityScore":0.8386,"matchedTerms":["pod"],"scoreBreakdown":{"vectorScore":0.0619,"bm25Score":0.3765,"contextBoost":0.6,"rrfScore":0.9839},"isCustom":false}]}}
